--
N5008 [dcl.init.list]/3.5, [over.ics.list]/7: `{}' for a parameter of class
type std::duration<std::ratio<1>> value-initializes it.  The cvise
reduction (/tmp/r163/red/kb_U5c) of test.desc: overload resolution
declared `{}' not viable for classes named std::chrono::*, std::ratio<...>
or std::__detail::*, a name-based guard, so the call found no match and
the calling member was dropped.  Fails on bin53.  g++ 13 and clang++ 18
accept the program.
